{"availability":"available","full":"ruyue0001/trace2env","name":"trace2env","description":"Agentic Language World Models","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":75,"forks":13,"created":"2026-10-04T11:53:44Z","updated":"2026-10-16T16:42:08Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.06100","topics":[],"demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Quanyu001/trace2env_demo","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-20T05:30:19.713Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-20T05:30:19.713Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-20T05:30:19.713Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T07:35:00.551Z","stars":17,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-10T17:28:45.502Z","stars":34,"forks":4},{"at":"2026-10-15T13:02:16.038Z","stars":66,"forks":12},{"at":"2026-10-17T12:30:41.585Z","stars":69,"forks":12},{"at":"2026-10-20T05:30:19.713Z","stars":75,"forks":13}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["🕹️ A Terminal simulated entirely by a world model agent.","src=\"assets/demo.gif\" width=\"800\" alt=\"Trace2Env simulating a stateful Terminal environment\""],"features":["Trace2Env is a training-free framework for agentic world modeling, designed for faithful, stateful, and long-horizon simulation of textual environments.","Environments built with Trace2Env can be used to train agents without the real system, test agents in safe and reproducible sandboxes, build stateful mocks for tools and APIs, or reconstruct unavailable, private, or…","Trace2Env does not recover the original executable system. Instead, it automatically reconstructs a model of the environment dynamics from observed action–observation trajectories.","Trace2Env is not tied to a particular environment domain. The paper evaluates it on terminals, software repositories, Android and web apps, enterprise services, and text games. The same framework can be applied to other…","Offline reconstruction. Past trajectories are processed and organized into a worldbook containing environment schemas, transition rules, constraints, invariants, observation contracts, grounded evidence, and…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ruyue0001/trace2env/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"2428b9eaf36669f684172d1f3666592af04f8c360a6f317191575a395404c129","extractedAt":"2026-10-17T12:30:41.689Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T12:30:41.689Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"🕹️ A Terminal simulated entirely by a world model agent.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ruyue0001/trace2env/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Trace2Env is a training-free framework for agentic world modeling, designed for faithful, stateful, and long-horizon simulation of textual environments.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ruyue0001/trace2env/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"The demo below needs no model and no API key.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ruyue0001/trace2env/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"2428b9eaf36669f684172d1f3666592af04f8c360a6f317191575a395404c129","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ruyue0001/trace2env/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T12:30:41.690Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-16T16:42:08Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ruyue0001/trace2env/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T12:30:41.691Z","hash":"2428b9eaf36669f684172d1f3666592af04f8c360a6f317191575a395404c129","originalBytes":16433,"storedBytes":16433,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T12:30:41.692Z","subjects":[],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Other","subjects":[],"evidence":[],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Games & game development","Simulation & physics","Automation & workflows","Android","Mobile","MCP servers & agents","Self-hosted apps"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Quanyu001/